<title>USA: Safari to make Czech guns in U.S.</title>
<headline>Safari to make Czech guns in U.S.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM, N.Y. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Safari Associates Inc said on Monday it has entered a tentative deal to assemble, market and distribute  Ceska Zbojovka of the Czech Republic's guns in the United States.</p>
<p>Ceska Zbojovka had $400 million in sales in 1995 and has set its sights on the $1.5 billion U.S. gun market, Safari said.</p>
<p>Safari sells outdoor recreation and sporting products.</p>
</text>
